Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.48,0:02:07.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(916.4,781.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Tears Fall on Electric Town
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hams for the song request.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.20,0:02:11.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go in full swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Pure Maid's Killer Kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.06,0:02:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Lady Boon effect is crazy.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:14.57,0:02:18.83,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(200,200)}I'm targeting you, moe kyun! Moe and blam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.78,0:02:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're raking it in like mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The curls before swine coffee, oink.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A shot of caffeine into my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.46,0:02:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.50,0:02:31.21,Insert Lyrics - English,,0,0,0,,{\blur6\fad(200,2000)}Open the secret door and come see me, Master
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.98,0:02:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.12,0:02:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought it foolish to assume that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.95,0:02:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pigs wouldn't understand\Nthe value of pearls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.10,0:02:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, I don't understand it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think pearls would suit\Nyou nicely, Miss Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, it looks like they're hitting it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that person after Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see quite the Mitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.24,0:02:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, piggies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.42,0:02:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to make\Na lot of honey money!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But doesn't Ronko kind of\Nsort of look interested, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Romance between Master and a\Nmaid is strictly off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko cannot break group rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They will disown her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.42,0:03:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't be able to\Nget out of Akiba alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I bet you Ronko could\Nfind a way to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I mean, it's all over\Nonce a maid falls in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.84,0:03:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko is an Akiba maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.58,0:03:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akiba maids don't fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it a riveting conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean the one I had with Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seahiro?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.71,0:03:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you remember his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I learned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.03,0:03:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, um, he asked if I wanted to go\Nout with him somewhere this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? All that? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you said yes to going out with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.36,0:03:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I've yet to reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.70,0:03:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.61,0:03:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're meeting him Saturday\Nat 11 in front of the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just went and told that guy yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, girls, he's a banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.42,0:03:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is lead him on a\Nbit and he'll lend us loads of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a banker would carry a briefcase\Nand wear a trench coat like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.32,0:03:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.70,0:03:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I set things up nicely, so\Nyou go have a word with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:58.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just about to head out. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Chief, this sort of\Nthing isn't allowed, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.50,0:04:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a little date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the cafes do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.96,0:04:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.98,0:04:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We await your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you looking forward to it, Ronko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.22,0:04:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.34,0:04:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean the date you're going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.22,0:04:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I am looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be rooting for your happiness\Ninstead of just being worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The idea of finding\Nhappiness is something I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cast aside when I entered\Nthe maid business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid cannot ever hope\Nfor that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.54,0:04:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've definitely had moments of true\Nhappiness getting to be a maid with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, I would love to\Nhelp you out with your date, Ronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have much experience going\Non dates, Nagomi? Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I don't. I lied.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,958.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.84,0:05:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must go out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.10,0:05:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A real woman never takes her wallet out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you become\Na woman of high value.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what I've always done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta feel good about how you\Nlook on a date, right girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the first time you've\Nbeen out with a master, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.20,0:05:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a dress I got from my Baan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:51.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you look mad nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.38,0:05:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you weren't that\Nbad looking to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.78,0:05:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the other maids won't recognize\Nthat lovely face of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think maids deserve to\Nfind true happiness too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:05.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go and enjoy yourself today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.38,0:06:11.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am determined to appreciate\Nthe time with my master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.36,0:06:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead of me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think\Nhappiness is supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you been waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't. Shall we then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look very nice today.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.15,0:07:00.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(404.6,827.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}11:30 ~ Strolling around Ueno ~ Browsing the Ameyoko Street Market
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Into the baggy bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll throw an extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, missus, how about you\Nbuy us some fish for dinner?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.75,0:07:17.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(599.8,819.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}13:00 ~ Eating Ranko's Bento at Ueno Park
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How nice did you make this\Nbento? I'm afraid that I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way that you just talked it's surprising\Nto hear you now for the first time I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,apologize I only know how to speak stiffly\NNo I really like the way that you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.57,0:07:52.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(632.4,833.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}14:00 ~ Seeing the Animals at Ueno Zoo
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,594)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Your first
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(513.4,634.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}apartment?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.36,0:08:31.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(730,745)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Huge sale on heaters
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End. Broken that might be\Nit. We should buy a kotatsu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.84,0:08:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could take it to my\Nplace and make some hot pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be so warm\Ni'm afraid we might fall
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.62,0:08:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,asleep together but that\Nwould be the best part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:09:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of it that does sound
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rather nice sorry didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i just say something\Ninappropriate you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.74,0:09:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Nwith me when i'm with you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.68,0:09:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i accidentally let my\Nguard down for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.78,0:09:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can we walk around for a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was actually supposed to do a job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been fixated on work for so long\Nthat I never take care of myself at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.76,0:09:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that's what I'm supposed to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.02,0:09:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, I've finally met you, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.54,0:09:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've finally met me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.86,0:09:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worn out emotionally, and\Nyou gave me a place of solace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I went to Oinkie Doon Cafe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could forget about work, and the way\Nyou talked to me would cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your frank but sincere attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.98,0:10:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you had occupied a place in my\Nheart before I even knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that, I'm going to\Nbe upfront and honest about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress Runco, would you run\Naway with me from Akiba, together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.48,0:10:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm heading up north on\Nthe night train tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.44,0:10:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to make a decision\Nby the time I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand that this proposition\Nis a bit sudden for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.32,0:10:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow night at nine, I'll be waiting\Nat the station's electric town exit.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(672,227)\frz11.45\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}LIMITED EXPRESS TICKET
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(703.6,266.8)\frz11.45\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}B Sleeper (Single Berth)
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(737.6,346)\frz11.45\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ueno    to    Sapporo
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.26,0:11:01.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(737.4,422)\frz11.45\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}(dep. 21:15)     (arr. 11:30)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something that you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you the\Nstory of a certain maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once, there was a young girl who came\Nto Akiba with dreams of becoming a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although she got to be a maid, all\Nshe was given was menial tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.22,0:11:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, a master appeared\Nwho took a liking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.82,0:11:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As her days as a maid had finally begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was tasked to do an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.42,0:11:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was to perform a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the head of a rival maid cafe.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.98,0:11:54.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(311.6,486.4)\fnPapyrus\fs41}Maid
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.98,0:11:54.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(280.2,568.8)\fnPapyrus\fs41}Teahouse
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly as some leaked\Ninformation had suggested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.56,0:11:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Target's cafe was incredibly\Nunderstaffed that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.12,0:12:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She pulled the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.34,0:12:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.46,0:12:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In terror,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.92,0:12:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the maid desperately told herself\Nshe would now rise in the ranks,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she was happy that she finally\Nhad a master who favored her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the truth was harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Him being a master was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The man had only approached me so he could
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eliminate me once I had served my purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.86,0:12:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They never meant to make me a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:54.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just disposable trash to them.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.98,0:13:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(880.4,164.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Panda Merch for Sale
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(13,271.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Noodles are made in a pan, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:21.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.78,0:13:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's what led to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know of Ronco\NManon from Maid Tea House?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:33.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the one who got jailed\Nfor avenging her manager, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.25,0:13:37.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(901.2,365.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}O-meow-ko Club
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.25,0:13:37.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(894.6,460.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}We'll grab you by the heart!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.25,0:13:37.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(900.6,511.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Safe for first-timers.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.25,0:13:37.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(900.6,598.6)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Hiring gyaru up to 21 y.o.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.54,0:13:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scary stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cafe claimed it was anti-violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The liars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.26,0:13:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time moved on without me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.89,0:13:43.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1065,307)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Maid Teahouse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Akiba changed over the years.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1014,305)\fnSwis721 BT\fs60}FOR LEASE
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.85,0:13:48.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1088,286)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.70,0:13:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.76,0:13:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.00,0:13:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the people of this town\Nhad forgotten what had happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Permission to speak\Nnumber 96 Ronko Manon 35
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.24,0:14:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,years old you appeared\Nand there I was The one
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who murdered the manager\Nof your cafe the only
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.82,0:14:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reason he approached\Nyou is to kill you Ronko
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must have hired\Nhim to do it he may
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.66,0:14:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have given up today but\NI can tell it's all a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.19,0:14:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he cares about is\Neliminating his target.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't go with him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do, he'll kill you\Nin Hakodate or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, I'm sorry I took the life\Nof someone who was so dear to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.32,0:14:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I should have told you\Nsooner, but I just couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a despicable pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.00,0:15:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell everyone at the cafe\Nthat I enjoyed my time. with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to send you off.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.56,0:15:19.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(779,505)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were out late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.05,0:15:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just kiss you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.97,0:15:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see the panda? Yes, we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.24,0:15:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got to spend some incredibly\Nprecious time at the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The arrangements that you made for\Nme, I very much appreciate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means the cafe's got it made!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see those ghosts raining\Ndown on us! Slow your roll! Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to send you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can never forgive you,\NAkachi Mashi, for killing Miss Michio.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then why\Naren't you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:07.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I think that Miss Michio\Nperhaps would never want that of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.78,0:16:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to take care of him. But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.20,0:16:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my Mistress, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I interest you in our singlet meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, thanks! Oiki-doi!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.06,0:16:37.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1328.2,171.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Kuroishi Precious Metals
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.06,0:16:37.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1358.8,212)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Metalworking Center
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for letting me bathe first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suehiro didn't come by\Nthe cafe today, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.34,0:16:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seeing you and your\Nmaster standing together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:17:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you make a really lovely twosome.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:02.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.22,0:17:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was kind of scared of him when\NI first noticed you two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.46,0:17:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think that was\Nonly because I was scared
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that he would take you\Nfrom us and oinky-doink,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.12,0:17:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.08,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, we almost drowned, got\Nkilled, we even had to grovel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got through all of that\Nbecause you were there, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you leave oinky-doink,\NI'll definitely be sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even when the time finally comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start practicing\Nfor your graduation so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can leave with a\Nproper smile on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't get emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it looks like you're already crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have you to thank, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.28,0:17:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never would have considered what\Nnormal happiness might be like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:57.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:17:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take care of\NOinky Doink Cafe for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.66,0:18:17.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1033.6,678.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ranko
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.06,0:18:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to settle this my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I seem to have made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:18:59.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to pick her up. No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.18,0:19:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that an accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That didn't sound good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, frickin' Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.78,0:19:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let Ronco live with the\Nburden of having to kill her master?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we have a nice little chat?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.4,236.6)\frz14.64\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}LIMITED EXPRESS TICKET
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(679.6,273.2)\frz14.64\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}B Sleeper (Single Berth)
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(697.6,397.2)\frz14.64\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Ueno    to    Sapporo
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.28,0:20:15.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(715,510)\frz14.64\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}(dep. 21:15)     (arr. 11:30)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.92,0:20:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your idea of making amends?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're back to being silent again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.56,0:20:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I just tell you one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.80,0:20:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one who had me kill Miss Michio was\Nthe current head of Creatureland, Nagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the one who gave\Nthe order this time, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.56,0:20:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how it's going to be.
