Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to kill Ronco Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.06,0:22:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I told you that crushing Oinky\NDoink Cafe is what the group decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.74,0:23:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refusing to kill her means defying\Nthe entire Creatureland group.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.64,0:23:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interpret it as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.80,0:23:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to settle it my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll cast your life before swine?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have questionable taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need you to\Nunderstand Miss Ronko's value.

